{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "來", "id": "來"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "夫子", "id": "夫子"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "易", "id": "易"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "暴", "id": "暴"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "正", "id": "正"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "variants": [], "id": "義"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "責", "id": "責"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.9760099665757773, "source": "事", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.9019019944220555, "source": "事", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "事", "target": "易"}, {"weight": 1.0560526742493137, "source": "事", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.2383742310432684, "source": "事", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 0.6505875661411494, "source": "身", "target": "正"}, {"weight": 2.1546649629174235, "source": "身", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 0.9019019944220555, "source": "身", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.9464244321454784, "source": "子", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 3.7232808808312687, "source": "子", "target": "敎"}, {"weight": 3.5409593240373143, "source": "子", "target": "易"}, {"weight": 2.1546649629174235, "source": "禮", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 0.9506921585914875, "source": "禮", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.000514283090165, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.0